#: setup.php
msgid "Periodic Export Cycle"
msgstr "Mzunguko wa Uhamishaji wa Mara kwa Mara"

#: setup.php
msgid "How often do you wish Cacti to Export Graphs.  This is the unit of Polling Cycles you wish to export Graphs."
msgstr "Je, ungependa Cacti ihamishe Grafu mara ngapi.  Hiki ni kipimo cha Mizunguko ya Ukusanyaji unachotaka kuhamisha Grafu."

#: setup.php
msgid "Every Polling Cycle"
msgstr "Kila Mzunguko wa Ukusanyaji"

#: setup.php
#, php-format
msgid "Every %d Polling Cycles"
msgstr "Kila Mizunguko %d ya Ukusanyaji"

#: setup.php
msgid "Hourly at specified minutes"
msgstr "Kila saa katika dakika zilizobainishwa"

#: setup.php
msgid "If you want Cacti to export static images on an hourly basis, put the minutes of the hour when to do that. Cacti assumes that you run the data gathering script every 5 minutes, so it will round your value to the one closest to its runtime. For instance, 43 would equal 40 minutes past the hour."
msgstr "Ikiwa unataka Cacti ihamishe picha tuli kila saa, weka dakika za saa za kufanya hivyo. Cacti inadhania kuwa unaendesha hati ya ukusanyaji wa data kila baada ya dakika 5, kwa hivyo itakadiria thamani yako hadi iliyo karibu zaidi na muda wake wa utekelezaji. Kwa mfano, 43 italingana na dakika 40 baada ya saa kamili."

#: setup.php
msgid "Daily at specified time"
msgstr "Kila siku kwa wakati uliobainishwa"

#: setup.php
msgid "If you want Cacti to export static images on an daily basis, put here the time when to do that. Cacti assumes that you run the data gathering script every 5 minutes, so it will round your value to the one closest to its runtime. For instance, 21:23 would equal 20 minutes after 9 PM."
msgstr "Ikiwa unataka Cacti ihamishe picha tuli kila siku, weka hapa muda wa kufanya hivyo. Cacti inadhania kuwa unaendesha hati ya ukusanyaji wa data kila baada ya dakika 5, kwa hivyo itakadiria thamani yako hadi iliyo karibu zaidi na muda wake wa utekelezaji. Kwa mfano, 21:23 italingana na dakika 20 baada ya saa 3 usiku."

#: setup.php
msgid "Use x Threads"
msgstr "Tumia Nyuzi x"

#: setup.php
msgid "How many background threads do you wish Cacti to use when exporting graphs.  Default is 0 to run all export in poller thread, 1 or more to spawn separate background threads"
msgstr "Je, ungependa Cacti itumie nyuzi ngapi za chinichini inapohamisha grafu. Chaguo-msingi ni 0 ili kuendesha uhamishaji wote katika uzi wa kikusanyaji, 1 au zaidi ili kuunda nyuzi tofauti za chinichini"

#: setup.php
msgid "Graph Selection & Settings"
msgstr "Uteuzi na Mipangilio ya Grafu"

#: setup.php
msgid "The user name to utilize for establishing permissions to Cacti Graphs.  This user name will be used to determine which Graphs/Trees can be exported.  N/A means don't assume any security is in place."
msgstr "Jina la mtumiaji la kutumia kuweka ruhusa za Grafu za Cacti.  Jina hili la mtumiaji litatumika kubaini ni Grafu/Miti ipi inayoweza kuhamishwa.  N/A inamaanisha usichukulie kuwa kuna usalama wowote uliowekwa."

#: setup.php
msgid "The Tree(s) to export."
msgstr "Mti au Miti ya kusafirisha."

#: setup.php
msgid "Expand Devices/Sites"
msgstr "Panua Vifaa/Maeneo"

#: setup.php
msgid "This setting determines if Tree Devices and Site Templates and Devices will be expanded or not.  If set to expanded, each host will have a sub-folder containing either Graph Templates or Data Query items."
msgstr "Mpangilio huu huamua ikiwa Vifaa vya Mti na Violezo vya Eneo na Vifaa vitapanuliwa au la. Ikiwekwa kupanuliwa, kila Kipangishi kitakuwa na folda ndogo iliyo na Violezo vya Grafu au vipengee vya Hoji ya Data."

