#: setup.php
msgid "Maximum Graphs to Export"
msgstr "Idadi ya Juu ya Grafu za Kuhamisha"

#: setup.php
msgid "After this number is reached, an error will be generated, but exporting will continue.  Set to 0 for no limit."
msgstr "Baada ya nambari hii kufikiwa, hitilafu itatolewa, lakini uhamishaji utaendelea.  Weka 0 kwa kutokuwa na kikomo."

