#: setup.php
msgid "Export Directory"
msgstr "Saraka ya Kuhamisha"

#: setup.php
msgid "This is the directory, either on the local system or on the remote system, that will contain the exported data."
msgstr "Hii ni saraka, ama kwenye mfumo wa ndani au kwenye mfumo wa mbali, itakayokuwa na data iliyohamishwa."

#: setup.php
msgid "Local Scratch Directory"
msgstr "Saraka ya Muda ya Ndani"

#: setup.php
msgid "This is the directory that Cacti will temporarily store output prior to sending to the remote site via the transfer method.  The contents of this directory will be deleted after the data is transferred."
msgstr "Hii ni saraka ambamo Cacti itahifadhi matokeo kwa muda kabla ya kutuma kwenye Eneo la mbali kupitia mbinu ya uhamisho.  Yaliyomo kwenye saraka hii yatafutwa baada ya data kuhamishwa."

